         than colors. Ordered so ADJACENT slices (which in practice are
         usually adjacent in the pie too, since slices are drawn in list
         order) jump hue meaningfully rather than sitting close together -
         green next to teal was a real problem: both sit in the same
         green-cyan hue range and nearly merged visually. -->
    <color name="chartSlice1">#2E7D32</color>
